# Project 1 — Automated Machine Learning

Project 1 implements a simple supervised machine learning pipeline through a Django interface.

## Features

The user can upload a CSV dataset directly through the webpage.

The application:

- Reads the uploaded CSV file
- Uses the final column as the target variable
- Visualizes the dataset
- Splits the data into 80% training and 20% testing data
- Trains a K-Nearest Neighbors classifier
- Tests different values of `k`
- Selects the best-performing value
- Displays the final test accuracy

The interface also displays a visualization of the uploaded data together with the model results.

## Machine Learning

The model used is K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN).

Several values of `k` are evaluated and the model with the highest test accuracy is selected.

The implementation uses Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib and Scikit-learn.

## Run

Start the main Django server from the repository root:

```bash
python manage.py runserver
```

Then open:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000/project1/
```
